# Converted from corpus/flowcharts/0202.mmd by corpus/convert.py.
Incoming HTTP Request -> Rate Limiter (Redis)
Rate Limiter (Redis) -> 429 Too Many Requests: Exceeded
Rate Limiter (Redis) -> Authentication Guard: Allowed
Authentication Guard -> Execute Controller Handler: Public route
Authentication Guard -> Validate JWT Bearer Token: Protected route
Validate JWT Bearer Token -> 401 Unauthorized: Invalid or Expired
Validate JWT Bearer Token -> Check Crop Ownership: Valid
Check Crop Ownership -> 404 Not Found (Prevent ID Enumeration): Not owned
Check Crop Ownership -> Execute Controller Handler: Owned
